>Matsuinu</i> follows the everyday adventures of six round and cuddly pooches that lead peaceful and relaxing lives, encouraging the audience to share in their warm and fluffy feelings.<br><br>\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2023, "episodes": 12, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": "#まついぬ", "genres": ["Comedy", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Animals", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Twins", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Family Life", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Iyashikei", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169296, "title": {"romaji": "Sumikko Gurashi Movie: Tsugihagi Koujou no Fushigina Ko", "english": "Sumikkogurashi: The Patched-Up Factory in the Woods"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "At an old factory on the edge of the forest, the Bear Factory Manager invites the Sumikkos to make toys. They make use of what they are good at, and complete their stuffed toys. The Sumikkos are motivated by the praise of the Bear Factory Manager. They have matching uniforms, delicious food, rooms to stay for the job, .and spend their days making one toy after another. Then, the toys that were shipped to Sumikko's town start moving around. There is something \"mysterious\" about this factory.<br><br>\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 11}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2023, "episodes": 1, "duration": 69, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "OTHER", "hashtag": "#映画すみっコぐらし", "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Animals", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Animal Cast", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Anthropomorphism", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Work", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Chibi", "rank": 79, "isAdult"