ason": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 10, "duration": 6, "countryOfOrigin": "KR", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Romance", "Supernatural"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169362, "title": {"romaji": "BURN THE WITCH #0.8", "english": "BURN THE WITCH #0.8"}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "\"Dragons\"... from ancient times, they were considered fictional creatures, but they're not actually fictional, nor are they technically creatures. They are heteromorphic beings, and many of the deaths in London can be attributed to them. But most citizens in London don't know what dragons look like or know they even exist. Only those who live in Reverse London can see them. In Reverse London, there was an agency called Wing Bind (WB for short) that was in charge of protecting and managing the dragons. And there were two witches who belonged to Wing Bind...\n<br><br>\n(Source: Crunchyroll)", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2023, "episodes": 1, "duration": 29, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": "#Burn_The_Witch", "genres": ["Action", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Witch", "rank": 96, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 85, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Magic", "rank": 84, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Dragons", "rank": 82, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Foreign", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban Fantasy", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Work", "rank": 75, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Shounen", "rank": 70, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Alternate Universe", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Idol", "rank": 46, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169363, "title": {"romaji": "SYNDUALITY: Kagaku Kouza", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "A short animation of the TV anime \"SYNDUALITY Noir\" posted on the EMOTION Label Channel.", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 9}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2023, "episodes": 12, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MULTIMEDIA_PROJECT", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Chibi", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169364, "title": {"romaji": "Ikimono-san", "english": null}, "format": "TV_SHORT", "description": "The series of shorts is based on Wada's \"My Exercise\" game about a curious boy who exercises with a dog. The boy encounters various creatures and tries to emulate them, with the valiant help of his dog. \n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 9}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2023, "episodes": 12, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "VIDEO_GAME", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Animals", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169370, "title": {"romaji": "Benghuai: Xingqiong Tiedao - Fei Guang", "english": "Honkai: Star Rail - A Flash"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Year 7380 Star Calendar, Jingliu, the mara-stricken swordmaster of the Luofu, slashed her way out of Starskiff Haven, cutting through the Cloud Knights tasked to subdue her before vanishing in the mist of history.\n<br><br>\nYear 8096 Star Calendar, a young soldier named Yanqing rose to fame from the tournament hosted by the Seat of Divine Foresight, and was conferred the rank of Cloud Knight Lieutenant.\n<br><br>\n\"The years pass in a flash, cups of wine the only solace.\"\n<br><br>\nA fleeting flash — thus is the speed of swift blades as the master and her student spar, and thus is the passage of the unceasing torrent of time.\n<br><br>\nJust how long has it been?\n<br><br>\nHis duel with his master, centuries ago, still rippled like a memory from yesterday.\n<br><br>\nBut the few years between now and when he took in the boy as his student felt like a lifetime.\n<br><br>\nTime gallops, swift as a stallion, sudden as a lightning strike, agonizing as a blade that runs him through. And yet, it feels like everything has always been the same.", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 5}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "VIDEO_GAME", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Fantasy", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Advertisement", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Adult Cast", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169372, "title": {"romaji": "Benghuai: Xingqiong Tiedao - Xuanhuang", "english": "Honkai: Star Rail - Ichor of Two Dragons"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "In the Year 4800 of the Star Calendar, the five lineages of the Vidyadhara made alliance on the Yuque, putting their sacred vow into writing. \"This oath shall remain unbroken, standing stronger than even earth and steel.\" — History of the Xianzhou: Exodus of the Five Dragons.\n<br><br>\nIn the Year 7379 of the Star Calendar, the Imbibitor Lunae Dan Feng caused turmoil that threatened the sacred wood. The Cloud Knights joined forces with the Vidyadhara Preceptors to assault him. — History of the Xianzhou: Cloud Knights War Records<br>\n\"Noble successor of the Azure Dragon, bearer of divine blessings from the heavens. Traversing clouds and bestowing rain, shaping forms as the world's essence beckons.\"\n<br><br>\nHe dreamed of shouldering his responsibilities, performing the ritual dance gracefully, and sealing the Ambrosial Arbor.<br>\nHe dreamed of stepping into a battlefield where sharp blades and arrows fell like rain, and meted out punishment from the sky.<br>\nHe dreamed of being chained between jade pillars, pierced by long nails, sealed in darkness.<br>\nHe dreamed of wandering aimlessly in the darkness, chased by lurking shadows.\n<br><br>\nIn all the dreams, he was a dragon, a hero, a sinner, but never a person with love, hatred, sorrow, or joy like everyone else in this world.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Honkai Star Rail Youtube Channel)", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 8}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 6, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "VIDEO_GAME", "hashtag": "#HonkaiStarRail #DanHengImbibitorLunae", "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Drama", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Magic", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Adult Cast", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Anthropomorphism", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Reincarnation", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169373, "title": {"romaji": "Higeki no Genkyou to Naru Saikyou Gedou Last Boss Joou wa Tami no Tame ni Tsukushimasu. mini", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Mini-animation of daily life that was not depicted in the film.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Twitter)", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 9}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2023, "episodes": 12, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "LIGHT_NOVEL", "hashtag": "#ラス為", "genres": ["Comedy", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Medieval", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Chibi", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Isekai", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Villainess", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169375, "title": {"romaji": "Bousei no Volicia", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "The anime takes place in 2006, and centers on Akio Hoshigami, who due to a leg injury is forced to give up on her dream of being a track-and-field star. Akio and her friend Ayano Umisoe move on to high school together. Amidst new activities and meeting new friends, Akio gradually starts acting like herself again. Then one day Ayano suddenly disappears.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 7}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2023, "episodes": 1, "duration": 32, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Mecha", "Romance", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Yuri", "rank": 100, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Super Robot", "rank": 95, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Gods", "rank": 85, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Aliens", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Shrine Maiden", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Guns", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "LGBTQ+ Themes", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Swordplay", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 70, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Female Cast", "rank": 70, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban Fantasy", "rank": 66, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Athletics", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169379, "title": {"romaji": "Yudatte Saikоu! Revice Anime Yukemuri Paradise A Go! Go!", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Kamen Rider Revice shorts released on the Toei Tokusatsu Fanclub (TTFC) app.", "startDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 7}, "season": "SPRING", "seasonYear": 2023, "episodes": 5, "duration": 8, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "LIVE_ACTION", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Chibi", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tokusatsu", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169402, "title": {"romaji": "Boku no Hero Academia: Yuuei Heroes Battle", "english": "My Hero Academia UA BATTLE HEROES"}, "format": "OVA", "description": "The stage this time is the UA dormitory just before season 5's Endeavor Internship arc! In the middle of winter, a hot and blustery cold battle is unfolding at Heights Alliance!\n<br><br>\nThird-year Mirio Togata appears suddenly as the first-year students in Class A are bored during their ban from going outside. He brings with him the card game \"Yuuei Heroes Battle,\" created by the support class. As each student picks cards and joins the fierce battle, there seems to be more to the game than meets the eye. At the end, who will emerge victorious?<br><br>\n\n(Source: Anime News Network) <br><br>\n<i>Note: The anime had a world premiere at tne New York Comic Con event on October 13 in English dub before the Japanese release in theaters.", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 10}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2023, "episodes": 1, "duration": 23, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#ヒロアカ #heroaca_a", "genres": ["Action", "Comedy", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 100, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Card Battle", "rank": 96, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Super Power", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Teen Cast", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Superhero", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Shounen", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ensemble Cast", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Artificial Intelligence", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cute Boys Doing Cute Things", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169442, "title": {"romaji": "Odekake Kozame × GAMERA: Rebirth", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Special episode of <i>Odekake Kozame</i> promoting <i>GAMERA: Rebirth</i>.", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 9}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 9}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2023, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Slice of Life", "Supernatural"], "tags": [{"name": "Crossover", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Animals", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Advertisement", "rank": 79,